<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Regal Cinema lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Regal Cinema lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James Financial said Wednesday it lowered its recommendation on Regal Cinema Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 1-1/8 to 32 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
